/-- ★ THE GAUGE COUPLING VIA THE SAME BORN TURN: `criticalPhaseNumerator = azimuthalTurn · 42`. The
    `α*=1/42` numerator `84π` (N329) is the SAME derived Born turn `2·cutPi` scaled by the channel
