      ≠ (1 - einsteinTraceReversalCoeff * (Module.finrank Cut STVC : Cut)) := by
  unfold einsteinTraceReversalCoeff; rw [finrank_STVC, inv_inv]; push_cast; norm_num

/-- ★ NON-VACUITY (W8): the trace-reversal `2` is load-bearing — `gravCouplingCoeff = 8·cutPi ≠
    gaussSphereSolidAngle = 4·cutPi`. Drop the trace-reversal factor and `κ = 4πG` (wrong): the `2`
